{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_07_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_07","title":"一錘定音","storyCode":"OF-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"39405f6b08891d8c5758eeaee64036933083d76ae5d8bc137294efba8fbd00ac","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雖然打敗了克洛寧，但一切似乎無法挽回。\n所幸，普羅旺斯帶了好消息，為了制止這場火山爆發，所有人都開始了行動。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟在我身邊十五年，什麼都沒有學會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"只學到了一些上不了檯面的手段，真是個蠢材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢材......呵呵，呵哈哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"老東西，你該不會以為這就是我的最後一步棋了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這......難道是火山爆發前引起的輕型地震？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_volcano"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來了，呵呵，終於來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟這座城市一起化為塵埃吧！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac3_volcano2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使現在你們想去控制廣播塔也晚了！市民只會陷入恐慌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火山的活動日期近在眼前，你們以為有了那些簡單的樣本資料就能搞清楚什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快速的逃生管道都在我手裡！你們誰都逃不走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"假裝清高的傢伙們，你們誰都救不了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一切都會隨著城市的毀滅被消滅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，怎麼辦！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"趕緊動員大家疏散人群！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"至少先讓大家離開危險地區！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，要不要通知羅德島全體......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，能聽到嗎！火山的分析研究完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果現在的話，還有機會能爭取到更多的時間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們已經把火山活動的原因找到了，這次的火山活動很有可能是可以被阻止的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在大家冷靜下來聽我說，只要按照這個方法來，一定能把火山爆發的時間推遲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以幫忙，如果真的是人力所及的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這件事就交給我們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛寧已經蟄伏了這麼長的時間，他的殘黨必然佈及整座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"現在正是最關鍵的時刻。黑，赫拉格爺爺，你們都有自己的事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情交給其他人去做就可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是我們的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天災信使，火山學家，源石學者，我們之中誰都不能容忍讓有所預兆的危機威脅到市民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更何況竟然有人利用自己的知識，蒙蔽他人，中飽私囊。作為天災信使，我可不能忍受自己在這種人面前還依然袖手旁觀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然也會有這麼認真的一面，我明白了。那麼市長先生，疏散群眾的任務，請容我助你一臂之力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。黑，你也來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"錫蘭說她可以做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......小姐，請務必小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"討論好了嗎？我們的時間不多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！我們趕緊出發吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該相信她，何況他們說的沒錯，我們有自己的事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哈哈哈——他們根本就是去送死！就算能拖延一時半會又如何！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅大半座汐斯塔要陪著你的女兒送葬，而你根本就找不到她的屍首——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，順手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨，何況他說的沒錯，不能讓市民們繼續身處險境了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你們能助我一臂之力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["赫拉格"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
